{"series":{"id":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin","slug":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin","title":"JX3: Chivalrous Hero Shen Jian Xin","image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/J/JX3:_Chivalrous_Hero_Shen_Jian_Xin/126xx11y756_ubslh5p3.jpg","synopsis":"La historia trata sobre un guardia de seguridad llamado Shen Jian Xin de la villa Esencia, un joven promedio determinado a convertirse en un héroe legendario. Mientras ofrecía sus respetos al palacio Yang de Jiang Hu, aprendió el secreto del palacio ancestral por accidente, sin embargo no tenía la mas mínima idea del poder que había obtenido. El entró en Jiang Hu y gradualmente maduró mientras experimentaba la agitación de Jiang Hu durante la próspera dinastía Tang. Quién sabe que peligros le deparan mas adelante...","status":"En emisión","year":2017,"genres":["Acción","Artes Marciales","Aventura","Comedia","Historico","Romance","Superpoderes"],"type":"donghua","src":"mundodonghua","sourceUrls":["https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin","https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin-3","https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin-2"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-20T15:17:54.325Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin-t1","slug":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin-t1","seriesId":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin","number":1,"image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/J/JX3:_Chivalrous_Hero_Shen_Jian_Xin/126xx11y756_ubslh5p3.jpg","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T15:17:54.325Z"},{"id":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin-t3","slug":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin-t3","seriesId":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin","number":3,"image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/J/JX3:_Chivalrous_Hero_Shen_Jian_Xin/126xx11y756_ubslh5p3.jpg","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T15:17:54.325Z"},{"id":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin-t2","slug":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin-t2","seriesId":"jx3-chivalrous-hero-shen-jian-xin","number":2,"image":"https://